    <!-- Health Connect -->
    <string name="ini_health_title">Building My Future and Health Connect</string>
    <string name="ini_health_intro">When you finish a workout in the app, we save that session to Health Connect (Google Health\'s platform) so your workouts show up alongside the rest of your physical activity.</string>
    <string name="ini_health_what">What we write</string>
    <string name="ini_health_what_body">• The exercise session (strength type) with its date and duration.\n• The details of each exercise and the weights used, in the session notes.</string>
    <string name="ini_health_only_write">The app only writes this data: it never reads your health information. You can revoke the permission at any time from Health Connect settings.</string>

